00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:08.920
Speaker 1: Teleological.

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:11.160
Speaker 1: Teleological argument.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:12.840
Speaker 1: Teleological argument.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:20.280
Speaker 1: Now, the first one says if there's something that was caused, if there was something that exists, it must have a cause.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:21.800
Speaker 1: That's a cosmological.

00:07:22.039 --> 00:07:24.200
