00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:34.900
Speaker 1: Intelligent design.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.500
Speaker 1: I'll paint an example.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.140
Speaker 1: Think about yourself walking into a forest.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:47.460
Speaker 1: And as you're walking, you get somewhere, you see some flowers nicely arranged.

00:07:48.019 --> 00:07:50.260
Speaker 1: And the flower tells you is.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:50.580
